<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14839" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῠρ-ίτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργῠρ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to silver,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				<i>containing silver-ore,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidon.
					48
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.184
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					34.9.10
				</span></i>
			; more freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρῖτις, ἡ,</span> as Subst.,
				<i>silver-ore,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὲψ ἀργυρίτιδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεργασάμενος τὴν ἀ.</span>
			Docum. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.28
			</span></i>; also a form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθάργυρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for money,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὼν ἀργυρίτης</span> a contest <i>in
				which the prize was money</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανίτης</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.820d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lync.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.584c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a moneyed man,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				442
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῖτις,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λινόζωστις ἄρρην</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.189
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
